.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824322_2359899831102218_1256630239015014359_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XV55xO5UWM4Q7kNvwF5Vsii&_nc_oc=Adr23jX7p1gFtqZL5uPgtUAtD8sjd2aZnuCggKy57Mqw_cnWJL5rCY1tpDtVJ1VbX3Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af55AzxMU4n9t8dVQTIZDwbB7OyYVr4GR7uDbigAqy44WA&oe=6A1C3210"}, "display_name": "VR BATTLEGROUNDS", "keywords": ["vrshooter", "multiplayervr", "tacticalfpsvr", "bankheiststory", "realisticmaps"], "long_description": "VR BATTLEGROUNDS delivers immersive tactical VR combat across four modes: Team Deathmatch (TDM), Story Mode, Rage Room, and an offline \"feels-like-online\" multiplayer. Realistic, high-fidelity maps, responsive VR gunplay, and customizable loadouts create cinematic, replayable encounters.\n\nStory Mode \u2014 Chapter 1: Bank Heist\nA downtown bank is under siege. Robbers hold staff captive and lock the vault. Your mission: breach, neutralize hostiles, and rescue every worker. Use cover, tactical breaching, and environmental interactions to clear each area \u2014 expect tense close-quarters combat and emergent encounters that reward strategy.\n\nTDM & Multiplayer\nJump into fast TDM across varied realistic arenas. Our offline multiplayer emulation adapts AI to skill, delivering competitive matches without servers \u2014 perfect for travel or private sessions.\n\nRage Room & Progression\nUnload in Rage Room, unlock weapons, skins, and attachments, and tune loadouts for assault, stealth, or long-range play.\n\nBuilt and optimized for Quest performance with regular updates. Note: multiplayer is offline but engineered to feel like live play. Strap in and dominate the battlefield.\n\nWhy you\u2019ll love it\n\u2022 Realistic maps with dynamic encounters for intense immersion.\n\u2022 Tight VR shooter controls, optimized for Quest performance.\n\u2022 Story-driven missions (start with the bank heist) plus quick TDM rounds.\n\u2022 Offline multiplayer that behaves like online play \u2014 great for travel and private sessions.", "short_description": "Lock, load, and dive into intense VR combat. VR BATTLEGROUNDS delivers realistic maps, heart-pounding TDM, a cinematic Story Mode (Chapter 1: bank heist \u2014 neutralize robbers and rescue hostages), a cathartic Rage Room, and a multiplayer experience that feels online while playable offline. Sharpen your skills, customize loadouts, and dominate fast-paced arenas. Tactical shooter action for Quest players who crave realism and replayability."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://abdurrehmanmma12327.github.io/privacy-policy/vrbattlegrounds/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Ascendrix Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://abdurrehmanmma12327.github.io/privacy-policy/vrbattlegrounds/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "2710427532541308"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25905660019120587"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 11, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "949016854508403"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "4270967636475702"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2181060275989364"}, {"status": "CANCELLED", "id": "2897967977073422"}, {"status": "CANCELLED", "id": "967249525875677"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1423958602801567"}, {"status": "CANCELLED", "id": "1262859608610755"}, {"sta